ed from one person to  another  the one who transfers it can still make  use of some leftover embers of the quark  although these embers will eventually  run out the stockpiled power that the  user of one-for-all has access to can be  channeled into a particular part of the  body or spread out throughout the whole  body focusing more power into one body  part such as an arm or a leg will put  more strain on that part of the body in  particular this body strain is  especially severe at first before the  user learns to control the power of the  quark and as we saw with Deku using the  quark without experience can lead to  broken fingers arms and legs but  eventually once the user learns to  control the quark he or she can learn to  control the percentage of the quarks  power that they are using at any given  time which helps to minimize the strain  one-for-all has an inner cord that has  gotten increasingly stronger as the  quark has been passed on from one user  to another which makes sense for a  stockpiling quark however as the story  goes on we eventually learned that as  one for all is being passed on from one  person to another the quark factor of  each user merges with the core of the  quark this unusual process has been  repeating for many generations and now  Deku the ninth one for all user is  slowly gaining the ability to manifest  the quirks of the previous one for all  users what's more these quirks have been  amplified by one for all stockpiling  power which means that Deku will  eventually have access to six new quirks  and these quirks will be even stronger  than they were back when they were  possessed by their original users so far  Deku has been able to reliably manifest  one of the six works and that quirk is  called black whip this quirk allows its  user to generate powerful black whips  from his body and these whips can be  used to grab things and people and also  to maneuver around more easily deck who  wasn't able to use the whips effectively  