r quirk  that all-4-one had stolen but of course  even if this is just the result of a  stolen quirk it still speaks to the  undeniable power of all-4-one and its  quirks stealing ability finally all for  one's ability to transfer stolen quirks  on to other people means that the user  can essentially create his own army of  villains with super-powered combo quirks  all-4-one is able to use his quirk  transferring ability to create the  powerful super soldiers known as the  nomal and in the future he intends to  make already powerful major villains  like shigaraki  even more powerful by giving him  additional quirks some believe that all  for one is planning to transfer to quark  all for one itself to shigaraki although  we are not yet sure whether this is even  possible  personally  I believe that in terms of pure  potential all-4-one might be the single  strongest quirk in boku no hero  just imagine the incredible potential of  being able to steal the quirks of others  combine them to create even more  powerful super kirk's that would never  have occurred naturally and also being  able to create an army of super soldiers  by giving them stolen quirks that they  could never have gotten otherwise as  long as you're willing to act like a  villain and steal the quirks of others  the power you could potentially attain  with all for one is truly immeasurable  but with that said all for one does have  some significant weaknesses one of them  is the quirk one for all which cannot be  stolen by all for one and which was  already used to defeat all for one  himself on two separate occasions in  both of those cases one for all has been  wielded by all might and so all might  has been able to decisively prove that  all for one is not unstoppable and as I  mentioned earlier one weakness of all  for one is the fact that you have to be  kind of amoral and willing to become a  villain in order to use it stealing the  quirks of others against their will and  conducting human experi